Changes:
 qt6-base (6.11.2+dfsg-5+stereo3d4) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * Sparky Stereo OS: a stereo QOpenGLWidget is a stereo window of its
     own on Wayland. New patch stereo3d-native-stereo-opengl-widget: a
     QOpenGLWidget that asks for stereo (its own format or the default
     format) is shown in a native window with a stereo format, a
     subsurface placed at the widget; the top-level window and the other
     widgets stay an ordinary one-eye surface, and a top-level window is
     stereo only when its own widget renders stereo (platform capability
     StereoNativeWindows, reported by Wayland when the EGL implementation
     has stereo surfaces). New patch stereo3d-wayland-defer-stereo-egl-
     surface: the EGL surface of a stereo window is created when the
     window is shown and sized, not at Qt's default 100x30, so a stereo
     window is not collapsed by the compositor after a first frame at the
     wrong size. Mono windows, xcb and every other platform are
     unchanged.
